      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the same is true for projects that where never queried with `PROTECTED` as a required flag. As the completed flags are a property of the `ProjectInfo` it looks like we will always get `branches\u003dNone` in `checkBranchCache()` and with that we also have a constant update of the protected flag.",
      "parentUuid": "d1528bff_5c61bdbe",
      "revId": "34ffdff527261eb30a6379120342cfa093d09538",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
